WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.160
1/6th of all Google searches have never been
searched before.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:18.119
When you suck on hard candy you are basically
drinking your own saliva mixed with flavourings.

00:00:18.119 --> 00:00:24.449
Hitler's handwriting was impeccable. When
famous psychologist Carl Jung saw hitler's

00:00:24.449 --> 00:00:31.340
handwriting he noted that Hitler's handwriting
suggests that he has highly feminine instincts.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:38.010
Only 1% of a tree is actually alive. The other
99% is hardened, dead cells.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:47.640
$1.2 trillion of US money is in circulation,
but nobody knows where 85% of it is.

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:55.500
The ice lost in Antarctica every year would
be enough to give every person on Earth 1,360,000

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:59.780
ice cubes.
It is possible to travel by zip wire from

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:05.119
Spain to Portugal.
Vegetables are roughly four times healthier

00:01:05.119 --> 00:01:09.850
than fruit.
Sweden is so good at recycling that they've

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:16.820
run out of rubbish and import 80,000 tonnes
a year from Norway. In fact, Sweden even recycles

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:21.640
dead rabbits into biofuel.
You are four times more likely to drown in

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:28.960
your bath than you are to die of food poisoning.
In 17th-century Virginia, missing three Sunday

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:34.579
Masses in a row carried the death penalty.

